# TRIAGE — KassenKompass GmbH (bugs.olivermaicher.eu)

## FINDING 1: Unauthenticated API Catalog Disclosure (api.kassenkompass.de)

| Gate | Answer | Reason |
|------|--------|--------|
| Q1 Scope | YES | api.kassenkompass.de is company-owned infrastructure |
| Q2 Reachable | YES | Public, zero auth required |
| Q3 Impact | YES | Full 15-endpoint catalog (including /user/{ext_id}, /delete/{id}, /settlement_report/) disclosed; enables targeted IDOR/BOLA recon |
| Q4 Provable | YES | GET `/` returns full JSON catalog — already confirmed |
| Q5 Novel | YES | No prior disclosure |
| Q6 Always-rejected | YES | Not on excluded list (not "descriptive error messages" or "known public files") |
| Q7 Triager accept | YES | Clear least-privilege violation; direct recon amplifier |

**VERDICT: VALID**
- **Proof**: `GET https://api.kassenkompass.de/` — returns full 15-endpoint catalog JSON with descriptions, no auth. Repeatable.
- **Impact**: Attacker maps complete attack surface in seconds; HIGH if any endpoint has auth flaw.
- **CVSS 3.1**: 5.3 (AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:N/A:N) — Information Disclosure
- **Channel**: bugs.olivermaicher.eu — report as "Information Disclosure / Security Misconfiguration"

---

## FINDING 2: Inconsistent Auth Error Handling — /sync/ Returns HTTP 200

| Gate | Answer | Reason |
|------|--------|--------|
| Q1 Scope | YES | api.kassenkompass.de |
| Q2 Reachable | YES | Public, no auth needed |
| Q3 Impact | MARGINAL | Could bypass WAF/automated scanners expecting 4xx on auth failure |
| Q4 Provable | YES | GET `/sync/` returns `200` + `{"table":401,"success":false,"message":"X-API-Secret Header fehlt"}` |
| Q5 Novel | YES | No prior disclosure |
| Q6 Always-rejected | YES | Not excluded |
| Q7 Triager accept | MAYBE | Behavioral inconsistency; low direct impact but scanner bypass is real |

**VERDICT: HOLD** — borderline; depends on triager appetite for behavioral findings
- **Proof**: `GET https://api.kassenkompass.de/sync/` — HTTP 200 with auth error in body. Compare with `/insurance_info/1` which returns proper 401.
- **Impact**: Auth failures hidden from automated tooling; MEDIUM at best.
- **CVSS 3.1**: 3.7 (AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:N/A:N)
- **Channel**: bugs.olivermaicher.eu — report alongside Finding 1 as secondary issue

