## Lead #12 — Funnel Cookie-Staffing / Unvalidated Pass-Params (ATTRIBUTION, 65-70)
**Asset**: kassenkompass.de / kassenkompass.net  
**Evidence**: `bonusrechner.php` mirrors raw URL params (lizenz→afilcode, jid→customerid, agn→agenturnummer, ppn→poolpartnernummer) into 1-year cookies with no validation; `afilcode` cookie lacks Secure/HttpOnly; 7 entry points with divergent alias maps; self-registration at abschluss.php with no CAPTCHA

| Gate | Answer |
|---|---|
| Q1 In-scope? | **YES** — kassenkompass.de is company-owned |
| Q2 Reachable? | **YES** — public funnel, unauthenticated |
| Q3 Impact? | **YES** — attacker crafts URL → victim's browser stores attacker-controlled attribution cookie → victim completes purchase → attacker receives commission (financial fraud); aflcode lacks Secure/HttpOnly → MITM interception |
| Q4 Provable non-invasively? | **YES** — `GET /bonusrechner.php?lizenz=ATTACKER&jid=VICTIM` → 200 + Set-Cookie confirms injection; read-only |
| Q5 Novel/unreported? | **YES** — no prior public disclosure found; confirmed across 7 entry points on both .de and .net |
| Q6 On always-rejected list? | **NO** |
| Q7 Reasonable triager? | **YES** — demonstrates real financial impact (commission fraud) with passive-only proof |

**Verdict: VALID**  
**Proof steps**: `GET https://kassenkompass.de/bonusrechner.php?lizenz=ATTACKER_AFIL&jid=VICTIM_JID&agn=VICTIM_AGN&ppn=VICTIM_PPN` → Observe `Set-Cookie: afilcode=ATTACKER_AFIL` (no Secure, no HttpOnly). Repeat on 7 entry points. Cookie persists 1 year.  
**Impact**: Attribution/commission hijack across entire insurance comparison funnel. Financial fraud.  
**CVSS 3.1**: AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:N/I:H/A:N — **6.5 (Medium)**  
**Reporting**: bugs.olivermaicher.eu — report + PoC + contact + payment

